{
  "abstract": "{\"business_domain\":[\"代理商-财务管理\",\"巨量营销-资金、钱包与结算\"],\"business_line\":[\"代理商\",\"巨量营销\"],\"capability_summary\":\"获取客户或代理商账户流水明细信息，支持按客户ID、时间范围、流水类型等条件查询。配合接口有【获取Access-Token】、【流水类型】、【附录-返回码】。\",\"id\":\"ad.advertiser_fund_transaction.get\",\"interface_path\":\"/open_api/2/advertiser/fund/transaction/get/\",\"method\":\"GET\",\"official_url\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/skiff/api/doc/client/markdown/get/?language=CHINESE\\u0026doc_id=1696710527205388\",\"related_docs\":[{\"id\":\"get_access_token\",\"path\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710505596940\",\"reason\":\"请求此接口需要先获取授权access-token\",\"relation\":\"前置接口\",\"title\":\"获取Access-Token\"},{\"id\":\"transaction_type\",\"path\":\"https://ad.oceanengine.com/openapi/doc/index.html?id=1696710760171535\",\"reason\":\"请求参数和应答参数中涉及流水类型的说明需参考此接口文档\",\"relation\":\"配合接口\",\"title\":\"流水类型\"},{\"id\":\"appendix_return_code\",\"path\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710760866831\",\"reason\":\"应答参数中返回码和返回信息的说明需参考此接口文档\",\"relation\":\"配合接口\",\"title\":\"附录-返回码\"}],\"risk_level\":\"low\",\"schema_url\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/skiff/api/doc/client/schema/markdown/get/?doc_id=1696710527205388\",\"title\":\"查询账号流水明细\"}",
  "content": "<div class=\"qz-editor-engine am-engine\" data-element=\"root\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-20D76bSx\">获取客户或代理商账户流水明细信息。接口规则如下：</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-MybcPJoL\">1.假设某客户A是代理商下客户，对于A来说，如果流水类型是转账，而收款方是A则意味着是转账加款，如果付款方是A则意味着是转账退款。</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-j9DIbivz\">2.假设某客户B是直客客户，未在任何代理商下，如果交易流水类型为充值，则收款方和付款方将都显示客户B，如果金额为正则是充值交易，金额为负则是退款交易。</p>\n<div class=\"qz-api-metadata\" data-type=\"apimetadata\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22interfaceId%22%3A%201768213669540875%2C%20%22docLibId%22%3A%201743864733602830%7D\">\n \n</div>\n<h3 data-id=\"h6f20189-vZrlsO8e\" id=\"h6f20189-vZrlsO8e\">请求地址</h3><p data-id=\"p838747a-LUsAbqqF\"><a href=\"https://ad.oceanengine.com/open_api/2/advertiser/fund/transaction/get/\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"blank\"><span style=\"color: #333333;\">https://ad.oceanengine.com/open_api/2/advertiser/fund/transaction/get/</span></a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/tools/visual_debug.html?docId=1696710527205388\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">可视化调试</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1773083358100557\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">SDK下载</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1847394521222599\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">MCP调用</a></p><h3 data-id=\"h6f20189-k8HPLvKE\" id=\"h6f20189-k8HPLvKE\">请求方法</h3><p data-id=\"p838747a-ghw4ktKu\">GET</p><h3 data-id=\"h6f20189-73NCp8pl\" id=\"h6f20189-73NCp8pl\">请求Header</h3><div class=\"table-container qz-card-type-block\"><table clas