k-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-Q1ssp8iT\">transaction_type <span class=\"qz-tag-view qz-tag-type-must\" data-type=\"tag\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22tagType%22%3A%22must%22%2C%22tagValue%22%3A%22%E5%BF%85%E5%A1%AB%22%2C%22isCustom%22%3Afalse%2C%22id%22%3A%22deFvT%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22inline%22%7D\" style=\"color:#338aff;background:#ebf3ff;\">必填</span></p></td><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-Z9ujr9IQ\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-PIzlNxm8\">string</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"td0a4e23-THFJBSmj\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-R8tZnCql\">流水类型，详见附录<a href=\"https://ad.oceanengine.com/openapi/doc/index.html?id=1696710760171535\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"blank\">【流水类型】</a>. 允许值: \"RECHARGE\", \"TRANSFER\"</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-JCpvxP2W\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-vBJZPzrR\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-Hxuf1xRU\">page</p></td><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-0BUBi4k5\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-EByGeyFJ\">string</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"td0a4e23-M2CLXJJy\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p dat